      "rationale": "Kĩhibirania kĩugaga 'ĩrĩ na mirongo ithatũ' (two-and-thirty); Gĩkũyũ gĩa rĩu gĩkundayo 'mirongo ithatũ na ĩrĩ' — thutha warĩ ũrĩa wonekaga."
